  "description": "Introducing the all new Cosmic Jay, a rugged fat tire electric bike from Euphree, built to carry anything and go anywhere. From asphalt paths to country gravel roads, the Cosmic Jay will power your way across all terrains. The BMX style bars and compact frame deliver an old school, mini bike ride experience that zips you wherever you need to go.\n\n﻿The unique geometry gives you a comfortable upright ride by bringing your pedals slightly forward. The wide 20x4\" CST low pressure fat tires provide a stable platform with plenty of give. Cruise on the Cosmic Jay for a fun utility electric bike with a moto feel.",
